1
00:00:05,463 --> 00:00:08,173
- I don't see anything at all, Sheldon.
- Ugh.

2
00:00:08,883 --> 00:00:12,303
You're the doctor, but I'm constantly
hearing this annoying sound.

3
00:00:13,471 --> 00:00:15,181
(Leonard:)Me too.

4
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:17,806
(Sheldon:)Is it a high-frequency whistle?

5
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:22,476
(Leonard:)No, it's more of a relentless,
narcissistic drone.

6
00:00:23,189 --> 00:00:25,439
Yeah, there's no inflammation at all,
Sheldon.

7
00:00:25,608 --> 00:00:27,858
Then it must be a tumor.

8
00:00:29,154 --> 00:00:30,784
(Steph:)I seriously doubt it.

9
00:00:30,947 --> 00:00:35,497
(Leonard:)Maybe it's a lingering bacterial infection
from all those childhood toilet swirlies.

10
00:00:36,995 --> 00:00:40,375
(Sheldon:)Is that possible?
I used to get those all the time.

11
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,790
(Sheldon:)Even in church.

12
00:00:43,168 --> 00:00:47,838
(Steph:)Well, you know, if it is from a swirly,
there's something I can do, okay. Ahem.

13
00:00:48,006 --> 00:00:52,756
(Steph:)Circle, circle, dot, dot,
now you have a cootie shot.

14
00:00:54,637 --> 00:00:55,717
(Steph:)- I'm going to bed.
- Okay.

15
00:00:55,889 --> 00:00:58,179
(Leonard:)- I'll be right in.
- Okay.

16
00:00:58,475 --> 00:00:59,975
It's not enough she mocks me...

17
00:01:00,143 --> 00:01:03,353
(Sheldon:)...but that isn't even the correct procedure
for a cootie shot.

